WEBVTT

00:17:59.277 --> 00:18:01.376
It's hard to do.

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:04.336
I think there's all kinds
of these new norms

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:07.096
that are being established just as we go.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:08.986
AG: When you communicate virtually,

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:10.534
what norms have you been setting

00:18:10.558 --> 00:18:12.905
to facilitate shared understanding?

00:18:12.929 --> 00:18:15.868
Maybe you've been encouraging people
to use the chat function

00:18:15.892 --> 00:18:17.746
so the quieter voices get heard.

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:19.966
Or you might be turning off your self-view

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:23.706
so you're not distracted
by all your weird facial expressions.

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:25.316
But if you're like most people,

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:28.266
you want to keep seeing
your team members' videos.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.096
You prefer that to audio-only